IMPORT `wa-interpretation-act-1984`
IMPORT `cat-act-facts`
IMPORT `cat-regulations-2012`
IMPORT `part-1-preliminary`
IMPORT `part-2-div-2-microchipping`

-- Cat Act 2011 (WA), compilation 00-l0-01, currency start 25 Sep 2025 (mrdoc_48898).
-- Part 2 Division 4 -- Transfer of ownership of cats: ss 22-24. LQA run cat-act-2011-lqa,
-- step 4A, 2026-10-01. In operation from 1 November 2013 (s 2(c)).

§ `Section 22 -- Terms used`

-- s 22: "purchaser, of a cat, means the person to whom the cat is transferred; seller, of a cat,
-- means the person by whom the cat is transferred."
-- FORK-14, reading A (taken): in a reclaim from a cat management facility (s 3(1) "transfer"
-- (b)) the cat is transferred by the facility's operator to the person who reclaims it, as s 33
-- speaks of a cat "reclaimed or otherwise transferred from that facility".
@ref Cat Act 2011 s 22 (FORK-14 reading A)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A STRING
`s 22 -- the seller in` tr MEANS tr's `the person parting with the cat`

@ref Cat Act 2011 s 22
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`s 22 -- the purchaser in` tr MEANS tr's `the person receiving the cat`

-- FORK-14, reading B: "transfer includes ... to reclaim from a cat management facility", so the
-- person who reclaims is the person by whom the cat is transferred.
@ref Cat Act 2011 ss 3(1) "transfer" (b), 22 (FORK-14 reading B)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A STRING
`s 22, reading B -- the seller in` tr MEANS
    CONSIDER tr's `kind`
    WHEN `reclaim from a cat management facility` THEN
        CONSIDER tr's `the person receiving the cat`
        WHEN JUST n THEN n
        WHEN NOTHING THEN tr's `the person parting with the cat`
    OTHERWISE tr's `the person parting with the cat`

§ `Section 23 -- Transfer of ownership of cats`

-- s 23(3), r 19: the section does not apply to a transfer to a body set out in r 9.
@ref Cat Act 2011 s 23(3); Cat Regulations 2012 r 19
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 23(3) -- section 23 does not apply to` tr IF
    `s 23(3), r 19 -- section 23(1) and (2) do not apply to` tr `, the facility being a cat management facility` (`s 3(1) -- the body is a cat management facility` (tr's `the recipient is`))

-- s 23(1): "A person must not transfer a cat that is not microchipped unless, at the time of the
-- transfer, the person is satisfied that a certificate referred to in section 14(2) applies in
-- respect of the cat. Penalty: a fine of $5 000."
@ref Cat Act 2011 s 23(1)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 23(1) -- contravened by the transfer` tr IF
        `the day number of` (`the date` 2013 11 1) AT MOST `the day number of` (tr's `made on`)
    ... NOT `s 23(3) -- section 23 does not apply to` tr
    ... "transfer a cat that is not microchipped" ... NOT `s 3(1) --` (tr's `the cat transferred`) `is microchipped on` (tr's `made on`)
    ... "unless, at the time of the transfer, the person is satisfied that a certificate referred to in section 14(2) applies"
        ... NOT tr's `transferor is satisfied that a s 14(2) certificate applies`

-- s 23(2): "A person must not transfer a cat that is not sterilised unless, at the time of the
-- transfer — (a) the person is satisfied that — (i) a certificate referred to in section
-- 18(2)(a) applies in respect of the cat; or (ii) the purchaser is an approved cat breeder and
-- the purchaser is purchasing the cat for the purpose of breeding; or (iii) the cat belongs to a
-- class of cats prescribed as exempt from sterilisation; or (b) a voucher is given to the
-- purchaser by the person to enable the purchaser to have the cat sterilised at a later date by
-- a veterinarian at no cost to the purchaser. Penalty: a fine of $5 000."
-- (a)(iii): no class is prescribed, so satisfaction that a cat belongs to one cannot be well
-- founded; the encoding requires both the satisfaction and the class (ENCODING-NOTES.md).
@ref Cat Act 2011 s 23(2)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 23(2) -- contravened by the transfer` tr IF
        `the day number of` (`the date` 2013 11 1) AT MOST `the day number of` (tr's `made on`)
    ... NOT `s 23(3) -- section 23 does not apply to` tr
    ... "transfer a cat that is not sterilised" ... NOT `s 3(1) --` (tr's `the cat transferred`) `is sterilised on` (tr's `made on`)
    ... "unless" ... NOT (    "(a)(i)" ... tr's `transferor is satisfied that a s 18(2)(a) certificate applies`
                          ..  "(a)(ii)" ... tr's `transferor is satisfied that the purchaser is an approved cat breeder purchasing the cat for the purpose of breeding`
                          ..  "(a)(iii)" ... tr's `transferor is satisfied that the cat belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from sterilisation`
                                         AND `no regulation -- belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from sterilisation` (tr's `the cat transferred`)
                          ..  "(b)" ... tr's `a voucher is given to the purchaser to have the cat sterilised later by a veterinarian at no cost to the purchaser`)

-- Who commits it: "A person must not transfer" -- the seller (s 22), on FORK-14's reading.
@ref Cat Act 2011 ss 22, 23 (FORK-14 reading A)
GIVEN n IS A STRING, tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the person named` n `contravenes s 23 by` tr IF
        n EQUALS `s 22 -- the seller in` tr
    ... (   `s 23(1) -- contravened by the transfer` tr
         OR `s 23(2) -- contravened by the transfer` tr)

@ref Cat Act 2011 ss 3(1), 22, 23 (FORK-14 reading B)
GIVEN n IS A STRING, tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `reading B -- the person named` n `contravenes s 23 by` tr IF
        n EQUALS `s 22, reading B -- the seller in` tr
    ... (   `s 23(1) -- contravened by the transfer` tr
         OR `s 23(2) -- contravened by the transfer` tr)

@ref Cat Act 2011 s 23(1); Interpretation Act 1984 s 72(1)(b)
GIVETH A `Penalty line`
`s 23(1) -- penalty line` MEANS `Penalty line` WITH
    `in`                                       IS "Cat Act 2011 s 23"
    `placement`                                IS `at the foot of a subsection, but not at the foot of the section`
    `the unit at whose foot it sits`           IS "s 23(1)"
    `subsections it is expressed to apply to`  IS EMPTY
    `maximum fine`                             IS 5000
    `the contrary is expressly provided`       IS FALSE

@ref Cat Act 2011 s 23(2); Interpretation Act 1984 s 72(1)(b)
GIVETH A `Penalty line`
`s 23(2) -- penalty line` MEANS `Penalty line` WITH
    `in`                                       IS "Cat Act 2011 s 23"
    `placement`                                IS `at the foot of a subsection, but not at the foot of the section`
    `the unit at whose foot it sits`           IS "s 23(2)"
    `subsections it is expressed to apply to`  IS EMPTY
    `maximum fine`                             IS 5000
    `the contrary is expressly provided`       IS FALSE

§ `Section 24 -- Notice to be given of transfer of cat`

-- s 24: "Within 7 days after the transfer of a cat, the seller of the cat must give notice in
-- writing — (a) to the local government with which the cat is registered, of — (i) the name and
-- address of the purchaser of the cat; and (ii) any other changes to the information prescribed
-- under section 12(3) in respect of the cat; and (b) to the microchip database company for that
-- cat, of — (i) the name and address of the purchaser of the cat; and (ii) any other changes to
-- the information prescribed under section 15 in respect of the cat. Penalty: a fine of $5 000."
-- (a) has an addressee only if the cat is registered on the day of transfer; (b) only if there
-- is a microchip database company for the cat. "Address" is read as the residential address.
@ref Cat Act 2011 s 24(a)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 24(a) -- notice to a local government is required for` tr IF
        `the day number of` (`the date` 2013 11 1) AT MOST `the day number of` (tr's `made on`)
    ... "to the local government with which the cat is registered"
    ... `s 3(1) --` (tr's `the cat transferred`) `is registered on` (tr's `made on`)

@ref Cat Act 2011 s 24(b)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 24(b) -- notice to a microchip database company is required for` tr IF
        `the day number of` (`the date` 2013 11 1) AT MOST `the day number of` (tr's `made on`)
    ... "to the microchip database company for that cat"
    ... `s 3(1) -- there is a microchip database company for` (tr's `the cat transferred`)

@ref Cat Act 2011 s 24; Interpretation Act 1984 s 61(1)(b), (e)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`, holidays IS A LIST OF `Calendar date`
GIVETH A `Calendar date`
`s 24 -- the last day for notice of` tr `given the holidays` holidays MEANS
    `s 61 -- the last day for a thing to be done within` 7 `days after` (tr's `made on`) `given the holidays` holidays

-- Whether a notice can name a purchaser at all: an offer for sale that nobody has taken up has
-- none (ENCODING-NOTES.md).
@ref Cat Act 2011 ss 22, 24
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 24 -- there is a purchaser to name in` tr IF
    CONSIDER `s 22 -- the purchaser in` tr
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
    WHEN JUST p THEN TRUE

GIVEN n IS A `Notice`, recipient IS A STRING, tr IS A `Transfer`, holidays IS A LIST OF `Calendar date`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 24 -- the notice` n `to` recipient `of` tr `is in time and names the purchaser, given the holidays` holidays IF
        n's `in writing`
    AND n's `given to` EQUALS recipient
    AND `the cat owner's full name` `is an item among` (n's `items`)
    AND `the cat owner's residential address` `is an item among` (n's `items`)
    AND `s 24 -- there is a purchaser to name in` tr
    AND `the day number of` (n's `given on`) AT MOST `the day number of` (`s 24 -- the last day for notice of` tr `given the holidays` holidays)

GIVEN ns IS A LIST OF `Notice`
      recipient IS A STRING
      tr IS A `Transfer`
      holidays IS A LIST OF `Calendar date`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 24 -- among` ns `a notice to` recipient `of` tr `is in time and names the purchaser, given the holidays` holidays IF
    CONSIDER ns
    WHEN EMPTY THEN FALSE
    WHEN n FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
            `s 24 -- the notice` n `to` recipient `of` tr `is in time and names the purchaser, given the holidays` holidays
        OR  `s 24 -- among` rest `a notice to` recipient `of` tr `is in time and names the purchaser, given the holidays` holidays

@ref Cat Act 2011 s 24; Interpretation Act 1984 s 72(1)(a)
GIVEN tr IS A `Transfer`
      notices IS A LIST OF `Notice`
      t IS A `Calendar date`
      holidays IS A LIST OF `Calendar date`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `s 24 -- the seller in` tr `contravenes the section, having given` notices `, on` t `given the holidays` holidays IF
        `the day number of` (`s 24 -- the last day for notice of` tr `given the holidays` holidays) LESS THAN `the day number of` t
    ... (    "(a)" ... `s 24(a) -- notice to a local government is required for` tr
                   AND NOT `s 24 -- among` notices `a notice to` (`the local government with which` (tr's `the cat transferred`) `is registered on` (tr's `made on`)) `of` tr `is in time and names the purchaser, given the holidays` holidays
         OR  "(b)" ... `s 24(b) -- notice to a microchip database company is required for` tr
                   AND NOT `s 24 -- among` notices `a notice to` (`the name of the microchip database company for` (tr's `the cat transferred`)) `of` tr `is in time and names the purchaser, given the holidays` holidays)

@ref Cat Act 2011 s 24; Interpretation Act 1984 s 72(1)(a)
GIVETH A `Penalty line`
`s 24 -- penalty line` MEANS `Penalty line` WITH
    `in`                                       IS "Cat Act 2011 s 24"
    `placement`                                IS `at the foot of a section, without qualification`
    `the unit at whose foot it sits`           IS "s 24"
    `subsections it is expressed to apply to`  IS EMPTY
    `maximum fine`                             IS 5000
    `the contrary is expressly provided`       IS FALSE

@ref Interpretation Act 1984 s 71(1)
GIVETH A `Kind of duty`
`s 71 -- s 24 is` MEANS `a duty to do a thing within a period or before a time`
